  "description": "SoftwareOne Marketplace credential provider for NextIteration.SpectreConsole.Auth. Ships SoftwareOneCredential, SoftwareOneToken, SoftwareOneAuthenticationService, and the Spectre.Console collector that drives the accounts-add prompt. The collector performs a live lookup against the Marketplace API at add-time to validate the token and enrich the credential with the account and token metadata.",
